{#- Inline search box. Rendered on collection index pages (Everything, Blog,
    Projects, Publications, Skills). Shares the same MiniSearch engine and
    search-index.json as the global search palette, so there is one index,
    one loader, and one set of results — only the rendering surface differs.

    The box filters results by the page's collection when data-filter is set,
    and shows all results when it is empty (the Everything page).

    Without JavaScript this is a plain, inert input inside a noscript-hidden
    container; the static list below it already shows everything. -#}
<div class="page-search" data-page-search{% if filterCollection %} data-filter="{{ filterCollection }}"{% endif %}>
  <input
    class="page-search__input"
    type="search"
    placeholder="{{ placeholder or 'Filter entries…' }}"
    autocomplete="off"
    spellcheck="false"
    aria-label="{{ placeholder or 'Filter entries' }}">
  <div class="page-search__results" aria-live="polite"></div>
</div>
